        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Leamington Spa, England\n- Organizations: Royal Spa Centre\n- People: Anthony Eden\n- Roles: Member of Parliament, Prime Minister of the United Kingdom, Foreign Secretary\n\nFacts:\n- The Royal Spa Centre is a theatre in Leamington Spa, England.\n- Anthony Eden was born on 12 June 1897 and died on 14 January 1977.\n- Anthony Eden was a British Conservative politician who served three periods as Foreign Secretary.\n- Anthony Eden served as Prime Minister of the United Kingdom from 1955 to 1957.\n- Anthony Eden was once the Member of Parliament for Leamington and Warwick.\n- The Royal Spa Centre was officially opened on 15 June 1972 by Anthony Eden.",
